=== Parallelepiped

Let it be defined by three linear independent vectors

$ arrow(u), arrow(v), arrow(w) $

==== Area delimited by two vectors

$ A = |arrow(u) times arrow(v)| $

==== Volume

$ V = |(arrow(u) times arrow(v)) dot arrow(w)| $

$ (arrow(u) times arrow(v)) dot arrow(w) = det mat(
  u_x, u_y, u_z;
  v_x, v_y, v_z;
  w_x, w_y, w_z
) $

or if you know the sides $a$, $b$, $c$, and the angles $alpha$, $beta$, $gamma$:

$ V = a b c sqrt(1 + 2 cos alpha cos beta cos gamma - cos^2 alpha - cos^2 beta - cos^2 gamma) $
